### ==================== 变量 ====================
# 先用 loginTest.http 的用例1或2登录，拿到 token 替换下面
@token = 59528c03-96e1-4fd2-989d-c1cbf84f86d9



### ==================== 视频上传测试 ====================

### 1. 正常上传 — 视频 + 封面 + 标题 + 简介
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/upload/video
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
token: {{token}}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

怪猎荒野太刀进阶教学
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

从开刃到登龙，一步一步教你成为太刀侠，包教包会
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="yinakong.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< C:/Users/ASUS/Downloads/yinakong.mp4
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cover"; filename="Snipaste_2026-04-09_14-57-54.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< D:/upload/fakecover/Snipaste_2026-04-09_14-57-54.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--


